# Documentation only: the server reads process environment, not .env files.
# Absolute directory OUTSIDE every Git checkout.
# Full migrated portal: contains legacy.json and immutable private releases/.
# Optional normalized monthly mode: contains validated dataset.json instead.
# MARKET_STRUCTURE_DATA_DIR=/absolute/private/runtime
# PORT=3000
# Unset MARKET_STRUCTURE_DATA_DIR shows the synthetic monthly demonstration.
# Full SQLite mode requires Node 24. Linux uses /proc; Windows uses a verified private temporary copy.
# Binds to loopback only. Add an authenticated private reverse proxy for remote use.
